@startuml
' ============================================
' ooad-phase:   物件設計
' chapter:      6-1
' realizes:     UC-01, UC-09, FR-04
' source:       frontend/focus-flow/src/main.jsx, frontend/focus-flow/src/authSession.js, frontend/focus-flow/src/App.jsx, frontend/focus-flow/src/AdminApp.jsx, backend/src/middleware/auth.middleware.js（程式碼）
' verified:     2026-09-19
' status:       draft
' implemented:  yes
' ai-assisted:  yes / OpenAI Codex / 依 pathname 分流、auth me 與錯誤邊界重繪
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title Session還原與角色入口循序圖

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "使用者" as User
participant "main.jsx" as Main
participant "App／AdminApp" as Entry
participant "restoreAuthSession()" as Restore
participant "apiFetch()" as ApiClient
participant "authenticate()" as AuthMiddleware
participant "AuthController" as AuthController
participant "AuthService" as AuthService
database "User model" as UserModel

User -> Main : 開啟一般網址或 /admin
Main -> Entry : 依 pathname 選擇 App／AdminApp
Entry -> Restore : restoreAuthSession()

alt localStorage 沒有 ff_token
  Restore --> Entry : ANONYMOUS
  Entry --> User : 顯示對應登入入口
else 有 ff_token
  Restore -> ApiClient : GET /api/v1/auth/me
  ApiClient -> AuthMiddleware : Authorization: Bearer JWT
  AuthMiddleware -> AuthMiddleware : verify(JWT_SECRET)
  AuthMiddleware -> UserModel : findById(sub)
  UserModel --> AuthMiddleware : active User／null
  alt JWT 無效、過期或使用者停用
    AuthMiddleware --> ApiClient : 401／403
    ApiClient --> Restore : invalid session
    Restore -> Restore : clearToken() + clearUser()
    Restore --> Entry : INVALID
    Entry --> User : 回到登入入口
  else 後端／網路暫時不可用
    ApiClient --> Restore : network／5xx error
    Restore --> Entry : UNAVAILABLE（保留 session）
    Entry --> User : 顯示重新驗證
  else 驗證成功
    AuthMiddleware -> AuthController : me(req.user)
    AuthController -> AuthService : getCurrentUser(userId)
    AuthService -> UserModel : findById(userId)
    UserModel --> AuthService : User
    AuthService --> ApiClient : 200 { public user }
    ApiClient --> Restore : AUTHENTICATED
    alt /admin 且 role = admin
      Restore --> Entry : requireAdminSession() 通過
      Entry --> User : 顯示管理員 Dashboard
    else /admin 且 role != admin
      Restore --> Entry : FORBIDDEN（不清除有效 session）
      Entry --> User : 顯示僅供管理員使用
    else 一般入口
      Restore --> Entry : 還原 student／teacher Dashboard
      Entry --> User : 回到角色允許頁面
    end
  end
end

note over Main,AuthMiddleware
  pathname 分流只決定前端入口；實際身分與角色仍由後端 JWT、active User 與 RBAC 決定。
end note

@enduml
